        {"zh": "枪声一停，我就找上你。", "en": "The moment the shooting stops, I come for you."},
        {"zh": "你的脚步声比枪响还响。", "en": "Your footsteps are louder than gunfire."},
        {"zh": "十点血，也要先开枪。", "en": "Ten health, but I still shoot first."},
        {"zh": "别跑，弹道已经算好。", "en": "Don't run. The trajectory is already calculated."},
        {"zh": "这条街的窗户，我都算过了。", "en": "I have ranged every window on this street."}
      ]
    },
    "targeting": {
      "operation": "replace",
      "lines": [
