        {"zh": "你的护甲厚度，我估过了。", "en": "I have estimated your armor's thickness."},
        {"zh": "准星压在你的膝盖上。", "en": "My crosshair rests on your knee."},
        {"zh": "枪管发烫，也没关系。", "en": "The barrel is hot. Doesn't matter."},
        {"zh": "你一探头，我就扣扳机。", "en": "Poke your head out and I pull the trigger."},
        {"zh": "这一发留给你跑的那步。", "en": "This round is for the step you're about to take."},
        {"zh": "别躲在木箱后，穿得透。", "en": "Don't hide behind crates. These rounds punch through."},
        {"zh": "退壳声一响，下一发已上膛。", "en": "The casing ejects; the next round is chambered."},
        {"zh": "我瞄准的不是你，是你的路。", "en": "I aim not at you, but at where you're going."}
      ]
    },
