        {"zh": "弹壳落在你脚边。", "en": "A shell casing lands by your feet."},
        {"zh": "枪管红了，你皮也焦了。", "en": "The barrel glows red, and so does your skin."},
        {"zh": "打偏了，退一步再来。", "en": "Missed. One step back and I try again."},
        {"zh": "你听见的最后一声是枪响。", "en": "The last thing you hear is the shot."}
      ]
